{"ref":"BDB, מֶ֫לַח²","hw":"מֶ֫לַח²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מֶ֫לַח</span></big>  <strong>n.m. salt (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مِلْحٌ</span> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܶܠܚܳܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלְחָא</span><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:26\" href=\"/Genesis.19.26\">Gn 19:26</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.13\">Lv 2:13</a>;—<em>salt</em> for seasoning food <a data-ref=\"Job 6:6\" href=\"/Job.6.6\">Jb 6:6</a>; offering <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.13\">Lv 2:13</a><sup>(×3)</sup> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.24\">Ez 43:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִית מֶ֫לַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:19\" href=\"/Numbers.18.19\">Nu 18:19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.5\">2 Ch 13:5</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.13\">Lv 2:13</a> v. Di); used in purifying waters <a data-ref=\"II Kings 2:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.2.20\">2 K 2:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 2:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.2.21\">21</a>; strewn on site of devoted city <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:45\" href=\"/Judges.9.45\">Ju 9:45</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:9\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.9\">Zp 2:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִכְרֵה־מ׳)</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.22\">Dt 29:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּפְרִית</span>); produced in marshes reserved for purpose <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.11\">Ez 47:11</a>; pillar of salt <span dir=\"rtl\">נְצִיב מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:26\" href=\"/Genesis.19.26\">Gn 19:26</a>; usually in combin. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָם(־) הַמֶּלַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:3\" href=\"/Genesis.14.3\">Gn 14:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(עֵ֫מֶק הַשִּׂדִּים)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:3\" href=\"/Numbers.34.3\">Nu 34:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:12\" href=\"/Numbers.34.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.17\">Dt 3:17</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָם הָעֲרָבָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:16\" href=\"/Joshua.3.16\">Jos 3:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:3\" href=\"/Joshua.12.3\">12:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:2\" href=\"/Joshua.15.2\">15:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:5\" href=\"/Joshua.15.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:19\" href=\"/Joshua.18.19\">18:19</a>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵיא־מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.13\">2 S 8:13</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.7\">2 K 14:7</a> Qr, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:2\" href=\"/Psalms.60.2\">ψ 60:2</a> (title), <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּיא הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.12\">1 Ch 18:12</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.11\">2 Ch 25:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.7\">2 K 14:7</a> Kt.","next":"BDB, מָלַח²","prev":"BDB, מלח"}